# Lee's book/script/email writing cache (Desktop\claude\chunks_cache.json,
# Desktop\claude\all_writings_content.json) -- belongs at the Desktop\claude\
# level, used by unrelated conversations, not part of this app at all. A
# 22MB copy of chunks_cache.json got committed into this repo by accident
# back in August (likely a stray `git add .` run from the wrong directory)
# and has been dead weight in every commit since -- Codemagic has to clone
# the full repo on every build, and this alone was more than half its
# total .git size.
chunks_cache.json
all_writings_content.json

# SQLite message store (chat_messages_sqlite.js) -- generated locally /
# on the Railway Volume from chat_messages.json, same as every other
# chat_*.json data file is never committed.
chat_messages.db
chat_messages.db-shm
chat_messages.db-wal
documents/pra-release-bundle
native-plugins/*/android/build/
